            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for an additional indication of scintigraphic assessment of sympathetic innervation of the myocardium by measurement of the heart to mediastinum (H/M) ratio of radioactivity uptake in patients with New York Heart Association (NYHA) class II or class III heart failure and left ventricular ejection fraction (LVEF) &lt; 35%.",
